---
import {siteConfig} from '../config/site';
import '../styles/global.css';
interface Props {title:string;description:string;image?:string;canonical?:string;type?:'website'|'article';noindex?:boolean}
const {title,description,image=siteConfig.socialImage,canonical:canonicalOverride,type='website',noindex=false}=Astro.props;
const pageTitle=title===siteConfig.name?title:`${title} | ${siteConfig.name}`;
const canonical=Astro.site?new URL(canonicalOverride??Astro.url.pathname,Astro.site).toString():undefined;
const socialImage=image.startsWith('http')?image:(Astro.site?new URL(image,Astro.site).toString():undefined);
---
<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator}/><title>{pageTitle}</title><meta name="description" content={description}/>{canonical&&<link rel="canonical" href={canonical}/>}<meta name="robots" content={noindex?'noindex,nofollow':'index,follow,max-image-preview:large'}/><meta name="theme-color" content="#12372d"/><meta property="og:type" content={type}/><meta property="og:locale" content={siteConfig.locale}/><meta property="og:site_name" content={siteConfig.name}/><meta property="og:title" content={pageTitle}/><meta property="og:description" content={description}/>{canonical&&<meta property="og:url" content={canonical}/>}{socialImage&&<meta property="og:image" content={socialImage}/>}<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><slot name="head"/></head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#konten">Lewati ke konten utama</a><header class="site-header"><div class="container header-inner"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Konsultan SNI–TKDN — Beranda"><span class="brand-mark">S<span>+</span></span><span class="brand-copy"><strong>Konsultan</strong><small>SNI · TKDN · BMP</small></span></a><nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Navigasi utama">{siteConfig.navigation.map(n=><a href={n.href} class:list={{active:Astro.url.pathname===n.href}}>{n.label}</a>)}</nav><a class="button button-small header-cta" href="/kontak/">Konsultasi ↗</a><details class="mobile-menu"><summary aria-label="Buka menu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></summary><nav>{siteConfig.navigation.map(n=><a href={n.href}>{n.label}</a>)}<a href="/kontak/">Kontak / Konsultasi</a></nav></details></div></header><main id="konten"><slot/></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="container footer-grid"><div><a class="brand brand-light" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">S<span>+</span></span><span class="brand-copy"><strong>Konsultan</strong><small>SNI · TKDN · BMP</small></span></a><p>Pendampingan persiapan dengan ruang lingkup kerja yang jelas, data yang tertata, dan proses yang transparan.</p></div><div><h2>Layanan</h2><ul>{siteConfig.services.map(n=><li><a href={n.href}>{n.label}</a></li>)}</ul></div><div><h2>Jelajahi</h2><ul><li><a href="/artikel/">Artikel</a></li><li><a href="/panduan/">Panduan</a></li><li><a href="/tentang-kami/">Tentang Kami</a></li><li><a href="/kontak/">Kontak</a></li><li><a href="/faq/">FAQ</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="container footer-bottom"><p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} {siteConfig.name}. Informasi bersifat umum.</p><p>Konsultan membantu persiapan dan pendampingan; keputusan resmi berada pada pihak berwenang sesuai skema yang berlaku.</p></div></footer></body></html>
